WEBVTT

00:03:59.544 --> 00:04:01.800
They couldn't find me,
they sent a search party,

00:04:01.824 --> 00:04:04.801
and I overheard people saying
they wish I had killed myself --

00:04:04.825 --> 00:04:06.667
jumped off Bible Peak.

00:04:06.691 --> 00:04:08.336
You can laugh, this is OK.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.752
(Laughter)

00:04:09.776 --> 00:04:11.976
This is me.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.469
This is what happened to me.

00:04:13.493 --> 00:04:16.976
And when I started my blog,
it was really this one goal --

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:22.696
I said, "I am not going
to be famous to the world,

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.174
but I could be famous
to people on the Internet."

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:26.358
And I set a goal.

00:04:26.382 --> 00:04:28.768
I said, "I'm going to win an award,"

00:04:28.792 --> 00:04:31.210
because I had never won
an award in my entire life.